# Advance AI Core Rules

- Product is **Advance AI**; repo/package is `copywrite-ai`
- Read `AGENTS.md` before non-trivial changes
- Minimal diffs — match existing patterns; no drive-by refactors
- Spanish domain terms stay in code: `guiones`, `negocio`, `venta_directa`
- Bilingual UI via inline `labels.es` / `labels.en` — no i18n framework
- All Supabase CRUD goes through `src/services/database.ts`
- Plan/usage enforcement is server-side only (`api/lib/auth.ts`)
- `supabase/` is gitignored — infer schema from `database.ts` + `types/index.ts`
- Ignore stale docs: README (5-question chat), PROGRESS.md (B-Roll/video), fal.ai references
- Update `docs/agent/CHANGELOG.md` for meaningful dev changes
- Dev full-stack: `npm run dev` + `npm run dev:vercel` (API on :3000)
